{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Supernatural Siege</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phandom: Demon Siege is a third-person shooter set in a world dominated by demonic creatures and supernatural entities. Blending intense action with level progression, the game offers an experience focused on tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face werewolves, demons, grotesque monsters, and abominations of darkness as you progress through corrupted environments, collect weapons and essential items, and try to escape alive from each encounter. The campaign unfolds across atmospheric and dangerous maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Progression with Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each environment in search of weapons, ammunition, and crucial items. Each level brings new challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental Co-op Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in online co-op mode. The focus, however, is on the single-player experience, where tension and difficulty stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive environments, somber design, and an immersive soundtrack create the ideal atmosphere for a journey through a world in spiritual collapse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370950?t=1764550910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370950?t=1764550910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370950/59486419d35977642efe26a27f9400d0eef180b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764550910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370950/59486419d35977642efe26a27f9400d0eef180b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764550910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Supernatural Siege</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phandom: Demon Siege is a third-person shooter set in a world dominated by demonic creatures and supernatural entities. Blending intense action with level progression, the game offers an experience focused on tension, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face werewolves, demons, grotesque monsters, and abominations of darkness as you progress through corrupted environments, collect weapons and essential items, and try to escape alive from each encounter. The campaign unfolds across atmospheric and dangerous maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Progression with Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each environment in search of weapons, ammunition, and crucial items. Each level brings new challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experimental Co-op Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in online co-op mode. The focus, however, is on the single-player experience, where tension and difficulty stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Immersive Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive environments, somber design, and an immersive soundtrack create the ideal atmosphere for a journey through a world in spiritual collapse.</p>","developers":["Clovek Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"CLOVEK GAMES ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370950/header.jpg?t=1764550910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min